# Build output lives outside the tree on purpose: this project's path contains
# non-ASCII characters and cl.exe cannot write a debug record into such a path.
# See .cargo/config.toml and docs/08-rust-port.md §4.
/target
/bin
*.exe
*.pdb
*.dSYM

# Scratch space for probes and local experiments.
/.cache

# Nothing here is generated into the source tree; if it appears, it is a mistake.
**/dist/
